# L0 = Crate, L1 = Shelf
# `item[name] = value` behind the construction may store into any field that a text or a symbol names: never into one under a private name. The flow passes private names by at reads and stores under
# computed keys; the writer of Link's tables said of every field of the layout, the private ones and the brand too, that it is written behind its construction.
# Shelf is the other side: its own method stores under the private name behind the construction, and that is still said.
